        <mxCell id="a_be_finalize" parent="lane_a_lane_backend" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#1E293B;" value="28 · FinalizeHandoverSessionAsync&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;• Bước 0: Kiểm tra Idempotency Retry&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;• Kiểm tra chữ ký: format base64, size &amp;amp;lt;= 512KB&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;• Đối soát đủ tệp: Server log == Client confirm&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;• &amp;lt;b&amp;gt;SignatureHash = SHA256(sigData)&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;• &amp;lt;b&amp;gt;ReceiptContentHash = SHA256(canonical)&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="260" x="20" y="1750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_be_close_session" parent="lane_a_lane_backend" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#1E293B;" value="29 · Cập nhật trạng thái bảo mật&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;• Grant.Status = FINALIZED (Đóng quyền tải)&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;• GuestSession.Status = COMPLETED (Thu hồi)&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;• Session.Status = COMPLETED" vertex="1">
